  "releaseNotes": "﻿### Fixed\n- git commands (and the test helper) no longer inherit the repository-locating `GIT_*` variables git sets for hooks, so the test suite run from a worktree's pre-commit hook no longer commits into, branches or reconfigures the real repository\n- Jobs: a job's log file is now flushed and closed as soon as the job finishes (success, failure, timeout or cancellation), before `job_status` reports it finished, so a wait on the log returns straight away instead of running to its timeout",
